{
  "format": "astro-canvas/workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "rbcodes-multi-spectrum-viewer",
  "name": "Multi-Spectrum Viewer",
  "description": "rbcodes rb_multispec as a workflow: three SDSS spectra stacked in the Multi-Spectrum Viewer, absorber systems found by the zfind absorber search seeded into its catalogue, the MgII doublet of the z = 1.3855 system identified, a velocity stack of that system and a quick Gaussian fit of MgII 2796. Export Line List writes the MultispecViewer JSON that rb_multispec reads back.",
  "nodes": {
    "load_qso": {
      "type": "core.io.load_spectrum",
      "title": "SDSS quasar (z = 3.01)",
      "pos": [
        40,
        120
      ],
      "params": {
        "path": "samples/rbcodes/sdss1.fits"
      }
    },
    "load_qso2": {
      "type": "core.io.load_spectrum",
      "title": "SDSS quasar 2",
      "pos": [
        40,
        480
      ],
      "params": {
        "path": "samples/rbcodes/sdss2.fits"
      }
    },
    "load_gal": {
      "type": "core.io.load_spectrum",
      "title": "SDSS galaxy (z = 0.0059)",
      "pos": [
        40,
        840
      ],
      "params": {
        "path": "samples/rbcodes/spec-0398-51789-0282.fits"
      }
    },
    "stack": {
      "type": "core.list.collect",
      "title": "Three sightlines",
      "pos": [
        400,
        400
      ],
      "params": {}
    },
    "igm_lines": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.curated_linelist",
      "title": "Intervening absorber lines",
      "pos": [
        40,
        1240
      ],
      "params": {
        "name": "zfind_igm"
      }
    },
    "absorbers": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.absorber_search",
      "title": "Absorber search (quasar 1)",
      "pos": [
        400,
        1240
      ],
      "params": {
        "z_min": 0.3,
        "z_max": 2.5,
        "n_steps": 2000
      }
    },
    "zcatalog": {
      "type": "rbcodes.zfind.absorbers_to_catalog",
      "title": "Top candidates",
      "pos": [
        760,
        1240
      ],
      "params": {
        "accepted": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      }
    },
    "catalog": {
      "type": "rbcodes.multispec.absorber_catalog",
      "title": "Absorber manager rows",
      "pos": [
        1120,
        1240
      ],
      "params": {
        "linelist": "LLS",
        "visible": false
      }
    },
    "viewer": {
      "type": "rbcodes.multispec.view",
      "title": "Multi-spectrum viewer",
      "pos": [
        760,
        80
      ],
      "size": [
        420,
        520
      ],
      "params": {
        "z": 1.3855,
        "linelist": "LLS",
        "catalog": [],
        "identifications": [
          {
            "name": "MgII 2796",
            "wave_obs": 6670.7025,
            "zabs": 1.3855,
            "wave_rest": 2796.3542,
            "spectrum": "sdss1.fits"
          },
          {
            "name": "MgII 2803",
            "wave_obs": 6687.8232,
            "zabs": 1.3855,
            "wave_rest": 2803.5315,
            "spectrum": "sdss1.fits"
          }
        ],
        "display": {
          "wave_min": null,
          "wave_max": null,
          "smooth_pixels": 1,
          "show_error": true,
          "show_labels": true
        }
      }
    },
    "export": {
      "type": "rbcodes.multispec.export_linelist",
      "title": "Export (MultispecViewer JSON)",
      "pos": [
        1500,
        80
      ],
      "params": {
        "path": "outputs/multispec-lines.json",
        "format": "json",
        "comment": "Multi-spectrum viewer template"
      }
    },
    "lls_lines": {
      "type": "rbcodes.lines.line_list",
      "title": "LLS transitions",
      "pos": [
        880,
        1700
      ],
      "params": {
        "name": "LLS"
      }
    },
    "vstack": {
      "type": "rbcodes.multispec.vstack",
      "title": "Velocity stack (z = 1.3855)",
      "pos": [
        1240,
        1700
      ],
      "params": {
        "z": 1.3855,
        "vmin": -800.0,
        "vmax": 800.0,
        "max_panels": 12
      }
    },
    "fit": {
      "type": "rbcodes.multispec.quick_fit",
      "title": "Quick fit: MgII 2796",
      "pos": [
        40,
        1700
      ],
      "params": {
        "x1": 6663.46,
        "y1": 7.26,
        "x2": 6675.75,
        "y2": 6.94,
        "kind": "gaussian"
      }
    },
    "readme": {
      "type": "core.note.markdown",
      "pos": [
        1500,
        560
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        340
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "# Multi-spectrum viewer\n\n`rb_multispec` as nodes.\n\n1. Three SDSS spectra are **collected** into one stack: two quasars and a star-forming galaxy.\n2. The **Absorber Search** scans quasar 1 with the `zfind_igm` list; **Absorber Catalog** turns its top candidates into the `Zabs`/`LineList`/`Color` rows rb_multispec's absorber manager uses, and they seed the viewer.\n3. Open the **Multi-Spectrum Viewer** editor on the viewer node: pan the shared wavelength axis, toggle line lists, type or slide the redshift, press `A` to add an absorber system at it, click a feature to identify the nearest line, and press `g` twice (or `c` twice) around a feature for a quick Gaussian / centre-of-mass fit. Apply writes the catalogues back into the node.\n4. **Export Line List** writes `outputs/multispec-lines.json` in MultispecViewer's own format (`metadata.application_name = \"MultispecViewer\"`), so rb_multispec's *Load* reads it back. Switch `format` to `txt` or `csv` for the fixed-width and CSV tables.\n5. **Velocity Stack** shows the `LLS` transitions of the z = 1.3855 system on a common velocity axis, and **Quick Line Fit** reproduces the viewer's `g` fit as a reproducible node.\n\nThe pre-identified MgII doublet marks the well-known z = 1.3855 absorber in `sdss1.fits` - the same system the absorption-line template measures."
      }
    }
  },
  "edges": {
    "e1": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "stack",
        "a"
      ]
    },
    "e2": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso2",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "stack",
        "b"
      ]
    },
    "e3": {
      "from": [
        "load_gal",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "stack",
        "c"
      ]
    },
    "e4": {
      "from": [
        "stack",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "viewer",
        "spectra"
      ]
    },
    "e5": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "absorbers",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e6": {
      "from": [
        "igm_lines",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "absorbers",
        "linelist"
      ]
    },
    "e7": {
      "from": [
        "absorbers",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "zcatalog",
        "result"
      ]
    },
    "e8": {
      "from": [
        "zcatalog",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "catalog",
        "absorbers"
      ]
    },
    "e9": {
      "from": [
        "catalog",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "viewer",
        "absorber_seed"
      ]
    },
    "e10": {
      "from": [
        "igm_lines",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "viewer",
        "extra_lines"
      ]
    },
    "e11": {
      "from": [
        "viewer",
        "identified_lines"
      ],
      "to": [
        "export",
        "identified_lines"
      ]
    },
    "e12": {
      "from": [
        "viewer",
        "absorbers"
      ],
      "to": [
        "export",
        "absorbers"
      ]
    },
    "e13": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "vstack",
        "spec"
      ]
    },
    "e14": {
      "from": [
        "lls_lines",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "vstack",
        "linelist"
      ]
    },
    "e15": {
      "from": [
        "load_qso",
        "out"
      ],
      "to": [
        "fit",
        "spec"
      ]
    }
  },
  "views": [
    {
      "id": "stack",
      "node": "viewer",
      "port": "view",
      "kind": "multispec-thumb"
    },
    {
      "id": "lines",
      "node": "viewer",
      "port": "identified_lines",
      "kind": "table"
    },
    {
      "id": "absorbers",
      "node": "viewer",
      "port": "absorbers",
      "kind": "table"
    },
    {
      "id": "significance",
      "node": "absorbers",
      "port": "out",
      "kind": "zfind-curve"
    },
    {
      "id": "velocity",
      "node": "vstack",
      "port": "out",
      "kind": "spectrum-stack"
    },
    {
      "id": "fit",
      "node": "fit",
      "port": "out",
      "kind": "table"
    }
  ],
  "requires": {
    "packs": {
      "astro-canvas-core": ">=0.1,<0.2",
      "astro-canvas-rbcodes": ">=0.1,<0.2"
    },
    "python": ">=3.10"
  },
  "meta": {
    "author": "rbcodes pack",
    "tags": [
      "template",
      "rbcodes",
      "multispec",
      "absorbers",
      "line identification"
    ],
    "default_layout": "dashboard"
  },
  "promoted": [
    {
      "node": "load_qso",
      "param": "path",
      "label": "Spectrum 1",
      "group": "Load",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "node": "load_qso2",
      "param": "path",
      "label": "Spectrum 2",
      "group": "Load",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "node": "load_gal",
      "param": "path",
      "label": "Spectrum 3",
      "group": "Load",
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "node": "viewer",
      "param": "z",
      "label": "Absorber z",
      "group": "Absorber",
      "order": 4
    },
    {
      "node": "viewer",
      "param": "linelist",
      "label": "Line list",
      "group": "Absorber",
      "order": 5
    },
    {
      "node": "absorbers",
      "param": "z_min",
      "label": "Search z min",
      "group": "Search",
      "order": 6
    },
    {
      "node": "absorbers",
      "param": "z_max",
      "label": "Search z max",
      "group": "Search",
      "order": 7
    },
    {
      "node": "vstack",
      "param": "vmin",
      "label": "Velocity min",
      "group": "Velocity stack",
      "order": 8
    },
    {
      "node": "vstack",
      "param": "vmax",
      "label": "Velocity max",
      "group": "Velocity stack",
      "order": 9
    }
  ],
  "layouts": {
    "dashboard": {
      "cols": 12,
      "row_height": 48,
      "items": [
        {
          "ref": "view:stack",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 4
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:velocity",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 3
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:significance",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 3
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:absorbers",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 7,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 4
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:lines",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 7,
          "w": 6,
          "h": 4
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:viewer.z",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:vstack.vmin",
          "x": 3,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "promoted:vstack.vmax",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 2
        },
        {
          "ref": "view:fit",
          "x": 9,
          "y": 11,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    "app": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Load",
          "items": [
            "promoted:load_qso.path",
            "promoted:load_qso2.path",
            "promoted:load_gal.path"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Absorber",
          "items": [
            "promoted:viewer.z",
            "promoted:viewer.linelist"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Search",
          "items": [
            "promoted:absorbers.z_min",
            "promoted:absorbers.z_max"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Velocity stack",
          "items": [
            "promoted:vstack.vmin",
            "promoted:vstack.vmax"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Results",
          "items": [
            "view:stack",
            "view:velocity",
            "view:absorbers"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
